SVGs are fetched at build time from jsDelivr into frontend/.cache/flag-src:
https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/twitter/twemoji@14.0.2/assets/svg/

`npm run flags:raster` clips these onto Twemoji's waving fabric
(U+1F3F3, no pole), crops uniformly to Apple Color Emoji ribbon
aspect (~1.42), and writes 32 / 64 / 96 PNGs to frontend/public/flags/.
